OL,3,AAramco Tower hit in heart of Saudi
OL,4,Acapital as Houthis launch fresh strikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Aramco Tower, a skyscraper in the
OL,7,FSaudi Arabian capital's central
OL,8,Ffinancial district, had been hit by an
OL,9,Fair attack.
OL,11,FA statement issued via the
OL,12,FHouthi-controlled Saba news agency
OL,13,Fconfirmed the group had targeted
OL,14,FRiyadh's business zone on Saturday,
OL,15,Fwithout mentioning the Aramco Tower by
OL,16,Fname.
OL,18,FThe Saudi energy ministry said the
OL,19,Ftower had suffered only "minor damage"
OL,20,Fand no one had been killed or injured.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
