OL,5,
OL,6,FFootage authenticated by BBC Verify
OL,7,Fshows more extensive damage to the
OL,8,Fbuilding, with at least one floor
OL,9,Fappearing to have been badly hit by a
OL,10,Fmissile or drone strike.
